# ===========================================================================
# PCMDE — public repository contents
#
# What ships: source code (core, cli, pipeline, analysis, metrics, domains,
# tests), per-domain configs, requirements, the shipped detection/VLM/ensemble
# JSONs needed to reproduce scores, and README.md.
#
# What stays local: manuscript material, every generated run output, figure
# generation, and superseded files. Rules are grouped below by reason.
# ===========================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Manuscript and internal documentation
#
# Only the top-level README.md ships. Everything under docs/ is paper and
# review material (PAMI PDF, ICML reviews, LaTeX sources and figures, the
# .docx ablation note) plus internal working notes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run outputs
#
# Nothing in results/ is source: every file there is produced by a pipeline
# run. Each writer creates its own output directory (parents=True), so a fresh
# clone rebuilds the tree on the first run -- no scaffolding needs tracking.
#
# Covers scores/, ablation/, crosscheck/, reference_run/, detections_annotated/
# and bundled runs such as results/pcmde_results_<date>/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/

# Annotated detection overlays, wherever a run is pointed instead of results/
**/detections_annotated/

# Shell-driver logs (scripts/run_domain.sh writes logs/<domain>_<n>_<step>.log)
logs/
terminal_output_*.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Figure and paper-number generation
#
# These read a local run directory and write into docs/LaTeX/figures. They
# reproduce paper artifacts rather than the framework, and make_projected_values
# emits projected (not measured) numbers, so neither belongs in a public repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
scripts/make_figure7.py
scripts/make_projected_values.py
figures/
*.eps

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded material
#
# archive/ holds outdated values from earlier runs, kept only for local
# reference. Nothing in the codebase reads it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
archive/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets
#
# Test images (~330 MB) are not distributed, but the folder itself is tracked
# via a .gitkeep so a fresh clone has somewhere to put them. captions.csv lists
# every image_id, which is the authoritative filename list.
#
# The detection / VLM / ensemble JSONs under data/ ARE tracked: they are the
# shipped inputs that let scores be reproduced without a GPU.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*/images/*
!data/*/images/.gitkeep

# Raw HiDream-I1 generation staging output (generated_2.py --output_dir).
# One-time intermediate: add_generated_images.py has already copied these into
# data/<domain>/images/ under their pipeline names.
dataset_output/
data/dataset_output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only
#
# tests/ is a personal check harness, not part of the distribution.
# .removed/ holds files pulled out of the project but kept on disk.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tests/
.removed/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# Test / lint / type-check caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments and secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
pcmdenv/
.conda/
.python-version

# API keys for the VLM / LLM backends (core/llm_client.py) live here.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
secrets.json
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Jupyter
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights (never commit these)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
weights/

# YOLOv12 notebook: Roboflow training exports, training runs, trained weights
# (pipeline/detection/yolov12_train_infer.ipynb)
datasets/
runs/
trained_models/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows / OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
*.stackdump
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
